# DONE

- **The whole site is built.** Home, Build (with a detail page per product), Think, World, Work with me,
  404s, all three languages, all routes.
- **Photo carousel.** `src/components/ui/photo-carousel.tsx`. Takes photos and labels as props, does no
  fetching and no translating, so it can sit on any page over any photo source. Fixed row height, each
  frame keeps its true shape, native scroll and snap, arrows retire under 900px.
- **Photo data layer.** `src/lib/photos.ts`. Fetches the R2 manifest, refreshes hourly, skips malformed
  entries, and falls back to the bundled samples if anything at all goes wrong, so the page never breaks.
- **Photo sync script.** `npm run photos:sync`. Rotates by EXIF, caps the long side at 3000px, re-encodes,
  generates blur placeholders, uploads, writes the manifest.
- **Blog plumbing.** Notion connection with the same safe fallback, in-place tag filtering, post pages.
- **SEO.** Every page builds its own canonical, hreflang, x-default, OG and Twitter cards. Products carry
  structured data. Sitemap covers everything.
- **Contact API.** Wired to Resend, validated, honeypot, HTML-escaped. Just not connected to any UI yet,
  see Phase 4.
- **Prod-swap redirects** written and waiting in `next.config.ts`.
- **Everything is committed and pushed.** Nothing is sitting unsaved on this machine.
